<title>USA: U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Bids mixed, slow sales.</title>
<headline>U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Bids mixed, slow sales.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dark northern spring wheat bids were mixed on Wednesday as dealers reported scant farm sales in the Northern Plains.</p>
<p>But movement slightly picked up early this week in areas of the Pacific Northwest as farmers tried capitalize on current wheat prices, several dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;There was a little bit of grower selling,&quot; an Oregon merchandiser said.</p>
<p>The lack of export activity also dampened some basis values,they said.  </p>
